## Paste an id from a create post response (POST /posts)
@postId = paste-post-id-here

## Delete post (soft delete) - expect 204, then GET returns 404 and the
## parent's replyCount and the author's postCount go down by 1
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}

###
## id not a UUID (ParseUUIDPipe) - expect 400
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/abc
